rue\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Z\"/></svg></span></button></div></article>","moment":"2026-11-25T00:40:03+08:00","precision":"instant","raw_time":"2026-11-25T00:40:03+08:00","source":"FinanceNewsDaily","topic":"国际","uid":"7282ea20892ac6bac7e86c63031c1788a04b46defe4fa33a9e52a946d3524e04"},{"alias":"FinanceNewsDaily","day":"2026-11-25","html":"<article class=\"g-card card news card--text\" data-cat=\"科技\" data-ch=\"FinanceNewsDaily\"><div class=\"g-card__label\"><span class=\"g-card__who\"><span class=\"source\" data-source=\"FinanceNewsDaily\">华尔街见闻·财经时讯</span><span class=\"cat\">科技</span></span><time datetime=\"2026-11-25T00:15:06+08:00\">00:15</time></div><h2 class=\"card__title\"><a href=\"https://t.me/FinanceNewsDaily/497085\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">报道：微软在历史性服务中断后宣布“红色警报”</a></h2><p class=\"card__body\">路透查阅的内部备忘录显示，在一次长达24小时的服务中断暴露了微软工程系统及危机响应机制的缺陷后，微软公司已发起一项“红色警报”（Code Red）行动，以彻底改革其预防和应对重大服务故障的方式。\n\n此次“红色警报”标志着微软发出的最严重、最紧急的警示，旨在解决其工程与运维实践中的薄弱环节——此前的中断不仅瘫痪了其云端电邮服务Exchange Online，还波及Outlook、Teams、CopilotAI助手以及其他Microsoft 365产品。</p><div class=\"card__actions\"><button class=\"g-btn g-btn--text expand\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>展开全文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-chevron-down\"/></svg></button><a class=\"g-btn g-btn--text\" href=\"https://t.me/FinanceNewsDaily/497085\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>阅读原文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-external-link\"/></svg></a><button class=\"icon-btn bookmark\" type=\"button\" data-bookmark=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;f9d7d8a20209812bc3b0e713147b832ce4b345fa4d83ac7fbc85e195dee6297e&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;报道：微软在历史性服务中断后宣布“红色警报”&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://t.me/FinanceNewsDail